<title>TURKEY: VA TECHNOLOGY UNIT SETS UP FIRM IN TURKEY.</title>
<headline>VA TECHNOLOGY UNIT SETS UP FIRM IN TURKEY.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian Energy and Environment, a unit of VA Technology Ltd, has set up a subsidiary in Turkey, Anatolian news agency said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>AE Enerji ve Cevre Koruma Teknigi Muhendislik Musavirlik ve Dis Ticaret Ltd has a capital of 7.7 billion lira, the agency said.</p>
<p>The company will be involved in power plants, and the production of steam, steam turbines, heaters and boilers, and also will offer planning and engineering services.</p>
<p>--Ankara newsroom, 90-312-4462940</p>
</text>
